icial Notification</strong>&nbsp;को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे । (<strong>Last Date, Age Limit, &amp; Education Qualification</strong>)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;UPSSSC Auditor / Assistant Accountant Online Form 2026 : Mode of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Preliminary Examination</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Mains Examination</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Final Merit List</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Apply Online Link</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Link Activate On 14 July 2026</strong></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Check Official